        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You curse the target with perpetually poor footing and wet boots. The target must attempt a Reflex save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target treats all terrain as difficult terrain for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target treats all terrain as difficult terrain, and it leaves a trail of water behind it, giving any skill checks to [[/act track]] it during the duration a +2 circumstance bonus. The duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, except the duration is 24 hours.</p>"
